:"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年前の自分と今の自分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここが変わったなあと思うところ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしくはここが変わったと人から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われるところはありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひブログのコメントにて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてください(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/02/06/5153449/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりり委員会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抜けてしまっている方いたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてください‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、2月お誕生日の方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてください‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月〇〇日まで教えてくださると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいです(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/02/06/5153449/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおおおおおおをををを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばけだぞおおおおこらあ、あああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"parag